how to install instructions 

How to Install on iOS (iPhone)
​Open Safari on your iPhone (Note: It must be Safari, as Chrome on iOS cannot install PWAs to the home screen).
​Go to your GitHub Pages URL:
[https://YOURUSERNAME.github.io/YOUR-REPOSITORY-NAME/](https://YOURUSERNAME.github.io/YOUR-REPOSITORY-NAME/)
​Tap the Share button at the bottom of the screen (the square with an arrow pointing up).
​Scroll down the share menu and tap Add to Home Screen.
​Tap Add in the top-right corner.
​How It Performs on iPhone
​Full Screen: Tapping the icon from your iPhone home screen opens your app in its own standalone window without Safari's top address bar or bottom menu controls.
​Offline Access: Your Service Worker (sw.js) will save the files locally on your iPhone, allowing it to open and function completely offline just like on Android.
